<p>It's also important to post consistently across all platforms as well--not just one or two of them! Many companies focus on one platform while ignoring others completely because they think there aren't enough users on those other sites (or maybe they just don't like them). However, if this happens then some customers may not see any content from their favorite brands at all!</p>

